c Negation of the tautology (a ∧ b) ∨ (a ∧ ¬b) ↔ a, encoded in DIMACS CNF.
c Variables: 1=a, 2=b, 3=a∧b (Tseitin), 4=a∧¬b (Tseitin), 5=(a∧b)∨(a∧¬b) (Tseitin).
c The formula is UNSAT: LHS = a for all (a,b) ∈ {0,1}², so ¬(LHS↔a) has no model.
c Verified as UNSAT by: CaDiCaL → drat-trim → lrat-trim → cake_lpr (HOL4-verified).
c
c Tseitin definitions:
c   3 ↔ (1 ∧ 2):      c1: ¬3∨1  c2: ¬3∨2  c3: 3∨¬1∨¬2
c   4 ↔ (1 ∧ ¬2):     c4: ¬4∨1  c5: ¬4∨¬2  c6: 4∨¬1∨2
c   5 ↔ (3 ∨ 4):      c7: ¬5∨3∨4  c8: 5∨¬3  c9: 5∨¬4
c   ¬(5 ↔ 1) (XOR):  c10: 5∨1  c11: ¬5∨¬1
p cnf 5 11
-3 1 0
-3 2 0
3 -1 -2 0
-4 1 0
